		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  correspondance grantor grantee group]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=2183#p2183"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Ceci doit fonctionner :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>SELECT pg_authid.rolname AS groname, pg_authid.oid AS grosysid, ARRAY( SELECT pg_auth_members.member
           FROM pg_auth_members
          WHERE pg_auth_members.roleid = pg_authid.oid) AS grolist
   FROM pg_authid
  WHERE NOT pg_authid.rolcanlogin;</code></pre></div><p>C&#039;est le code de la vue pg_group.</p>]]></content>
